@local/dsh-digital-pet README · 忙的时候，也可以放心去忙：总有赶进度、出差，或者想关掉电脑休息的日子。

插件提供**离线保护与托管照护**：长时间离线会进入自动照护，也可以主动开启托管。它不会因为你偶尔忘了喂食而提前离开。饮水会自动补给，缺少口粮时还有免费救济入口。

回来之后，再给它一个招呼就好。

@local/dsh-digital-pet README · 慢慢长大，留下属于你们的故事：从小小一团，到活泼的青年，再到戴上眼镜的老伙伴——形象和小动作，会随着年龄一起变化。

每位宠物拥有 **六个自然月**的生命周期，托管期间也会继续长大。旅程结束后，这段陪伴会留在**纪念册**里；之后可以再次领养，金币和背包也会保留。

希望你记住的，是它曾经在工作区的角落，认真朝你挥过的小手。

@local/dsh-digital-pet README · Turn a short break into a small ritual：By default, **1,000,000 eligible tokens earn 1 coin**, with a daily cap of 100 coins. The exchange rate and daily cap can be configured. The Host records and deduplicates usage; check the coin-details panel for your progress.

Your first adoption comes with a welcome gift. Free relief food is also available when inventory and cooldown conditions are met.

</details>

@local/dsh-digital-pet README · It's okay to be busy：Some days are for deadlines, travel, or simply closing your laptop and getting some rest.

The plugin includes **offline protection and boarding care**. Longer absences trigger automatic care, and you can also enable boarding yourself. An occasional missed meal will not end your pet's life early. Water is replenished automatically, and free relief food is available when supplies run low.

Come back when you're ready. A little hello is enough.

@local/dsh-digital-pet README · Grow together, and keep the memories：From a tiny bundle to a lively youngster, and eventually an old friend with glasses—its appearance and little gestures change as it grows.

Each pet has a lifespan of **six calendar months**, and it continues growing while in boarding care. When that journey ends, your time together is recorded in the **memory album**. You can adopt again afterward, keeping your coins and inventory.

We hope you'll remember the little friend in the corner of your workspace, waving just for you.

@local/dsh-digital-pet README · Help this little project grow：Saves are stored separately for each local profile. Cross-device sync is not available in the current version. See the developer guide for more installation, configuration, and development details.

---

<p align="center"><strong>A little friend for everyone putting care into their work.</strong></p>
